      "html": "<p>For a very long time this species of Corydoras, the type species of the entire genus, was a myth. It is still a top rarity among the corys.</p><p>The breeder Kurt Jülich succeeded in breeding it from wild-collected specimens. The youngsters of this offspring are still rather drab in colour, so pictures of adult fish were supplied by Ernst-Otto von Drachenfels and Jürgen Glaser.</p>"
